    "detailed_description": "In the distant future, the CYBERACE cybernetic research enterprise is holding their very first &quot;EX-XDRiVER Championship,&quot; a racing championship with a priceless reward\u2014any cybernetic enhancement that the winner desires. With such an enticing reward, contestants have traveled from around the world to compete in a high stakes, winner-take-all tournament in hopes to make their deepest desires come true.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636020/extras/287db94861fb8f38e8cb19c48fe4760e.avif?t=1744984279\" width=616 height=198 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RIDE THE NEON CIRCUIT</h2>Immerse yourself in a futuristic landscape of neon, sleek raceways and an addicting high-energy soundtrack. Enjoy a track list with over 15 artists providing a wide variety of original music &amp; licensed songs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUSH THE LIMITS OF RACING</h2>Traditional rhythm game gameplay will be easy to learn but require mastery and practice as you tackle technical high-level tracks. Obtain &quot;LIMITs&quot; from hitting notes and drifts as accurately as you can\u2014go for perfect scores, faster finish times, and world records!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HONE YOUR SKILLS, COMPETE FOR GLORY</h2>Play solo in an arcade-style credits mode to unlock songs for Free Play\u2014or if you're feeling competitive, connect online and race against others to see who deserves the title of XDRV Champion!",
